# platform.pico.stdio

The Pico SDK platform's USB CDC implementation of mm.stdio. Both Pico SDKs
bind it as their default console provider, so every SDK-backed Pico board gets
it unless that board declares a more specific binding.

The provider calls a private C ABI implemented by the bridge's one adapter.
It includes no Pico SDK header and exposes no SDK type to portable code.
